{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero Warning: Burnt Out is an anomaly horror game set in an undersea rail tunnel. This claustrophobic escape room game confronts the player with surreal anomalies, a gripping story, and disaster horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot-the-Difference Anomaly Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the inside of the undersea rail tunnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't find any anomalies, go forwards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot an anomaly, go back the way you came.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade dangerous anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery as you venture further into the fire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Five Unique Levels:</strong> jump into the action in the unique setting of the undersea rail tunnel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d26f1e0769d8f16f8a784bddf156dce2.poster.avif?t=1759203640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d26f1e0769d8f16f8a784bddf156dce2.webm?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d26f1e0769d8f16f8a784bddf156dce2.mp4?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 Anomalies To Encounter:</strong>\u00a0anomalies can range from subtle to obvious, ridiculous or scary, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/5d984dd81d60a442cffaa1068c834127.poster.avif?t=1759203640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/5d984dd81d60a442cffaa1068c834127.webm?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/5d984dd81d60a442cffaa1068c834127.mp4?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Story and Environmental Worldbuilding:</strong> discover the dark secret of the undersea rail tunnel, as you piece together details of the dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/161b53ef3adb1f43cbdaa23ec94ab906.poster.avif?t=1759203640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/161b53ef3adb1f43cbdaa23ec94ab906.webm?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/161b53ef3adb1f43cbdaa23ec94ab906.mp4?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undersea rail tunnel.\u00a0</strong>See the horror for yourself, spot anomalies, learn secrets, and try to make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/db1e403fba030d4fddc56a367342b1f8.poster.avif?t=1759203640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/db1e403fba030d4fddc56a367342b1f8.webm?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/db1e403fba030d4fddc56a367342b1f8.mp4?t=1759203640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029840?t=1759203640","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/115b5d865da9efaa378507ab9d9e046e9f326d3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759203640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/ecae744149df66329e9dc04b98a7e40cee1b4598/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759203640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/ecae744149df66329e9dc04b98a7e40cee1b4598/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759203640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game deals with fire victims. Some mentions of chemical weapons, and implied murder."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero Warning: Burnt Out is an anomaly horror game set in an undersea rail tunnel. This claustrophobic escape room game confronts the player with surreal anomalies, a gripping story, and disaster horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot-the-Difference Anomaly Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the inside of the undersea rail tunnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't find any anomalies, go forwards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot an anomaly, go back the way you came.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade dangerous anomalies.</p></li><li><p clas